# in a static build (SQLRELAY_ENABLE_SHARED=no) this directory's Makefile
# generates sqlrconfigdeclarations.cpp, sqlrconfigassignments.cpp,
# sqlrpwdencdeclarations.cpp and sqlrpwdencassignments.cpp from the
# matching .cpp.in templates, by globbing ../configs and ../pwdencs object
# files at make time - config.mk.in's STATICUTILPLUGINSRCS.  the .cpp.in
# templates are hand maintained and stay tracked (#9678)
/sqlr*declarations.cpp
/sqlr*assignments.cpp
